+## Availability (Preview)
+
+The FX Quotes API is available in the following countries, and you can use it to display localized prices in the [supported currencies](https://docs.stripe.com/currencies.md#presentment-currencies). The following table shows which regions support payment and transfer usage types, along with their available lock durations. Any region that supports locking for a given usage type, also supports the `none` lock duration to retrieve informational quotes.
